    "description": "<b>Gym Workout Planner & Tracker - Alpha Progression.</b>\r\nMaximize your gains and track your gym workout routines & programs with Alpha Progression - the ultimate fitness app. Our app goes beyond creating a personalized workout plan; it empowers you to track your progress and achieve your fitness goals. With an extensive exercises database and expert recommendations, we provide the guidance you need to embark on an effective workout routine & muscle building journey.\r\n\r\n<b>PERSONALIZED MUSCLE BUILDING & WEIGHT LIFTING WORKOUT PROGRAMS</b>\r\nExperience gym workout plans backed by science, tailored to your objectives and needs. With Alpha Progression, you can choose your training frequency and target muscles during your gym workouts.\r\n\r\n<b>GYM WORKOUT TRACKER - TRACK YOUR WORKOUT ROUTINES</b>\r\nOur gym tracker feature includes a rep counter, weight lifting and RIR tracker, allowing you to monitor your progress. Our note-taking and gym log features help enhance your strength training. Plus, our convenient rest timer keeps you in sync with your next set.\r\n\r\n<b>GYM WORKOUT PLANNER - REACH YOUR WEIGHT LIFTING GOALS</b>\r\nWe celebrate your achievements by providing a list of personal records and milestones. That way, we ensure you're constantly inspired and rewarded for your hard work. For both men or women, our app creates personalized strength training plans to elevate your gym workout routine & muscle building journey. You can create your own plans for added customization.\r\n\r\n<b>PROGRESSION RECOMMENDATIONS</b>\r\nGet the most out of your gym workout routine with our advanced algorithm. By analyzing your past workout programs & performances, we provide you with recommendations on weight lifting and reps, ensuring you achieve maximum muscle gain through progressive overload.\r\n\r\n<b>VAST EXERCISE DATABASE - 620+ VIDEOS</b>\r\nWith our extensive library of 620+ exercise videos, you'll learn and perform each exercise with precision and safety. With our exercise evaluations you'll gain insights into the muscle building & strength training potential of each exercise. Categorized by targeted muscles and equipment, you\u2019ll always find ideal gym workout programs.\r\n\r\n<b>GET INSIGHTS</b>\r\nOptimize your strength training with our graphs and insights. Visualize your workout programs history,  and analyze how your muscle building and strength training have evolved over time thanks to the gym tracker.\r\n\r\n<b>COMPREHENSIVE PERIODIZATION</b>\r\nYou can structure your weight training & strength workouts in cycles and deloads. Also create a progressive plan where the number of sets and the level of effort (RIR) increase gradually week by week. This approach ensures progressive overload and promotes continuous gains, helping you maximize your results and achieve your fitness objectives.\r\n\r\n<b>SHARE YOUR PLANS</b>\r\nShare your gym workout planner, routines & programs with friends or coaching clients. Easily distribute your plans, allowing recipients to customize them according to their needs.\r\n\r\n<b>DATA EXPORT</b>\r\nExport your training data as a .csv file, compatible with apps like Excel. This feature enables you to analyze your statistics, easily tracking your progress\r\n\r\n<b>SUBSCRIPTIONS</b>\r\nEnjoy the free version of Alpha Progression, or unlock the full potential with our Pro version. Subscribing to Pro grants you access to exclusive features such as the plan generator, progression recommendations, graphical analytics, and more.\r\n\r\nDo you have questions about the app? Please send us an email at info@alphaprogression.com\r\n\r\nTerms of service: https://alphaprogression.com/terms\r\nPrivacy policy: https://alphaprogression.com/privacy",
